> This document outlines the strategic direction for NexaTech Solutions Inc. for the fiscal years 2026 through 2028. It details our long-term vision, strategic pillars, key initiatives, and financial targets, providing a roadmap to guide our growth and solidify our position as a market leader.

## 1. Executive Summary

Over the next three years, NexaTech Solutions will focus on accelerating growth, achieving profitability, and establishing itself as the undisputed leader in the AI-powered business intelligence market. Our strategy is centered around three core pillars: **Product Innovation**, **Go-to-Market Expansion**, and **Operational Excellence**.

We will deepen our technological moat by launching our next-generation autonomous analytics agent, expanding our platform's integration capabilities, and continuing to invest in our AI-first architecture. We will accelerate our go-to-market expansion by entering the Latin American market, scaling our channel partnerships, and further penetrating the enterprise segment. Operationally, we will focus on scaling our infrastructure, investing in our talent, and driving efficiencies to achieve EBITDA profitability by FY 2027.

By executing on this plan, we aim to achieve a revenue of **$250 million** by the end of FY 2028, grow our customer base to over **5,000 organizations**, and prepare the company for a potential Initial Public Offering (IPO) in 2028.

## 2. Mission, Vision, and Values

*   **Mission:** To empower organizations worldwide with intelligent, scalable, and intuitive data analytics solutions that transform raw data into actionable business insights.
*   **Vision:** To become the global leader in AI-powered business intelligence platforms, recognized for innovation, customer success, and sustainable growth.
*   **Values:** Innovation First, Customer Obsession, Integrity & Transparency, Collaboration, Excellence, and Sustainability.

